                <pb facs="1156" n="1036" xml:id="pg1036"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">837.513/54: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Representative on Special Mission in Cuba</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Crowder</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-07-05"><hi rendition="#italic">July 5,
                        1922</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>39. Your 41, June 30, 5 p.m.</p>
                <p>Department desires to commend you for the admirable way in which you have handled
                    the negotiations and for the results obtained.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
